  m_text: 'heya! this is a small update that doesnt add much due to us atually working
    on the island now. enjoy!


    - Redid the pause menu to fit the new menu

    --
    Settings is in the pause menu

    - Grabbables have been reworked

    -- Physics
    based, you can rotate them with Q and zoom them in with scroll wheel

    - Pressing
    Z on the into brings you to the scene selecter.

    - Pressing R lets you spawn
    blocks (test)

    - Added new intro text

    - Fixed bugs, and probally added
    some'
